WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.474 --> 00:00:19.766
At it was the Little Mermaid's fifteenth birthday.

2
00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:26.252
"Today will be your first day in the Upper World," announced her grandmother.

3
00:00:26.272 --> 00:00:29.114
"I'm so excited!"

4
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:31.036
squealed the Little Mermaid.

5
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.821
"I've been waiting so long for this day."

6
00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:41.163
The Wise Mermaid placed a wreath of white lilies in the Little Mermaid's hair.

7
00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:47.004
Then she hooked four oysters on her tail, a sign of royalty.

8
00:00:47.024 --> 00:00:49.865
"Ouch! That hurts!"

9
00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:51.406
cried the Little Mermaid.

10
00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:58.528
"A small sacrifice for becoming a 15-year-old princess," said her grandmother.

11
00:00:59.948 --> 00:01:03.489
The Little Mermaid had to agree the oysters looked lovely.

12
00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:07.070
But she was anxious to start her adventure.

13
00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:11.511
"Please hurry, Grandmother," she begged.

14
00:01:11.531 --> 00:01:15.332
"Go ahead, dear," her grandmother said.

15
00:01:15.352 --> 00:01:17.553
"But don't stay too long.

16
00:01:18.873 --> 00:01:22.814
Remember, your place is here, under the sea."

17
00:01:24.155 --> 00:01:28.896
Impatiently the Little Mermaid hugged her grandmother good-bye and swam away.

18
00:01:30.284 --> 00:01:34.226
When the Little Mermaid got to the surface, the sun was just setting.

19
00:01:35.487 --> 00:01:39.670
She saw the sky turn from blue to pink.

20
00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:44.572
As night fell, the sky turned deep purple and sparkled with stars.

21
00:01:46.213 --> 00:01:48.915
Soon the moon poured light on the sea.

22
00:01:48.935 --> 00:01:53.157
"It's so beautiful in the Upper World!"

23
00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:55.119
exclaimed the Little Mermaid.

24
00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:00.929
In the distance the mermaid saw a ship with three tall masts.

25
00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:06.671
She swam closer and saw that the ship was standing still in the water.

26
00:02:08.071 --> 00:02:11.712
Music was playing, and she saw bright, colored lights.

27
00:02:13.193 --> 00:02:15.913
Sailors moved about on the ship's top deck.

28
00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.074
They walked on two legs.

29
00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:22.235
"Humans?" she wondered.

30
00:02:22.795 --> 00:02:24.416
"What a strange sight."

31
00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:30.563
Excited, she swam right up to the side of the ship and peeked through a window.

32
00:02:31.664 --> 00:02:34.985
Inside, more humans were singing and dancing.

33
00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:38.067
All of them were dressed in fine clothes.

34
00:02:38.087 --> 00:02:40.889
"It looks like a party!"

35
00:02:41.049 --> 00:02:41.569
she thought.

36
00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:48.393
The mermaid studied each human carefully until her eyes fell upon a young man.

37
00:02:48.413 --> 00:02:52.916
"Oh, how handsome," she thought.

38
00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:57.767
Her eyes followed him as everyone went up on deck.

39
00:02:57.787 --> 00:03:06.375
"We remember when you were born, dear Prince, 16 years ago," said a woman with a blue feather

40
00:03:06.415 --> 00:03:06.955
in her hair.

41
00:03:06.975 --> 00:03:09.377
"He's a prince!"

42
00:03:09.737 --> 00:03:11.099
exclaimed the Little Mermaid.

43
00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:17.504
Another guest said, "With your kind heart, you'll be a great king some day!"

44
00:03:17.524 --> 00:03:21.788
"May every year be as happy as this one!"

45
00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:24.285
added a man, holding up his glass.

46
00:03:24.306 --> 00:03:27.588
"Happy Birthday, Prince!"

47
00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:29.549
the crowd cheered.

48
00:03:29.569 --> 00:03:33.812
"Everyone loves him," thought the Little Mermaid.

49
00:03:33.832 --> 00:03:36.634
"He must be wonderful."

50
00:03:38.215 --> 00:03:42.818
Rockets shot into the air and exploded into a thousand tiny lights.

51
00:03:44.099 --> 00:03:48.542
The water reflected the fireworks, and the entire ocean glowed.

52
00:03:48.562 --> 00:03:50.604
"Oh my!"

53
00:03:51.136 --> 00:03:53.117
The mermaid had never seen such a sight.

54
00:03:54.557 --> 00:03:57.059
Frightened, she quickly dived underwater.

55
00:03:58.359 --> 00:04:02.121
But looking up through the water, she soon lost her fear.

56
00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:06.342
"So many sparkling flowers in the sky!"

57
00:04:06.863 --> 00:04:07.763
she exclaimed.

58
00:04:08.963 --> 00:04:15.386
The Prince hugged his guests, shook their hands, and said, "Thank you for a lovely celebration."

59
00:04:16.727 --> 00:04:19.688
The Little Mermaid swam up to the surface and watched.

60
00:04:20.864 --> 00:04:23.665
The Prince was the most beautiful of all the humans.

61
00:04:25.146 --> 00:04:27.607
He was as beautiful as the statue in her garden.

62
00:04:28.807 --> 00:04:32.449
But soon the music stopped, and the colored lights were put away.

63
00:04:32.469 --> 00:04:34.930
"Thanks for all your help!"

64
00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.831
said the Prince to his crew.

65
00:04:36.851 --> 00:04:39.272
"It was a great party."

66
00:04:40.592 --> 00:04:43.694
Then the Prince and his guests went below the deck to sleep.

67
00:04:44.914 --> 00:04:49.056
But the Little Mermaid could not swim away from the ship or the handsome Prince.

68
00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:53.587
For her it was love at first sight!
